# RUNBOOK — Project Summary object + manual editor (no LLM)

**What this builds:** the `[SA New Dev] Project Summary` object type and a Workshop page to view / write / save summaries by hand — for real projects (`iSTEP25B`, `iSTEP26B`) **and** arbitrary subjects (`program_cascade_reporting`). No Logic functions, no wrappers, no harness dependency. The AI layer (generate / revise / proposal cards) comes later and adds on top with zero rework.

**Self-contained.** Everything needed is on this page. Sources of truth it was assembled from: WS-UC2 §1.1/§3, BUILD-ROADMAP §4b C1/C2/C4/C5/C6a. If this page and those ever disagree, those win — but as of 2026-08-02 they say the same thing.

**Time:** ~1.5–2 h total. Naming convention reminder: display names `[SA New Dev] <Name>`, API names `saNewDev…` camelCase — substitute your generated API names when pasting code.

