## STEP 1 — Backing dataset (seed transform, ~10 min)

Add one output to `transforms/seed_backing_datasets.py` in the `harness-backing` repo and run the build once. Object Storage V2 layers all action edits on top of this empty dataset; re-running is harmless.

```python
PROJECT_SUMMARY_SCHEMA = T.StructType([
