## STEP 6 — Acceptance test (~5 min)

| # | Do | Expect |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Open with a fresh `subjectId` | Empty section shows |
| 2 | Start writing → type → Save | View mode: your text, ✍️ manual, your user id, `v1` |
| 3 | Edit → change → Save | `v2`, `lastSavedAt` updated |
| 4 | Edit → paste 700 chars → Save | Readable error at the button ("Summary is 700 chars — limit is 600"), still editing |
| 5 | Open with `program_cascade_reporting` | Same flow works — no project behind it, FK dangles harmlessly |
| 6 | Check the history section | Edit History shows both versions; Action Log Timeline shows each save with user + time |

